Dear Diane,
I hope you are doing well.
Thank you for taking the time to meet with us and discuss your business=
 requirements. It was a pleasure learning more about your operations an=
d understanding your objectives.
As discussed, please find the attached proposal for the SGC Tech ERP so=
lution, prepared specifically based on the requirements shared by your =
team.
The proposal outlines our recommended phased implementation approach:
 * Phase 1: CRM and core business operations, including lead management=
, client database, follow-up reminders, employee management, attendance=
, task management, mobile access, training, and go-live support. * Phas=
e 2: Advanced capabilities such as KPI dashboards, property listings ma=
nagement, WhatsApp Business integration, portal integration, and AI-pow=
ered automation. * Phase 3: Finance and integrated operations, includin=
g accounting, payroll, commission management, and business intelligence=
 dashboards.
The proposal also includes the implementation timeline, project methodo=
logy, pricing structure, support model, and recurring platform services=
 to provide complete transparency throughout the project.
We believe this phased approach will enable your team to adopt the syst=
em smoothly while allowing it to scale as your business grows.
Please take some time to review the proposal with your team. If you hav=
e any questions or would like to discuss any section in more detail, I =
would be happy to arrange a call at your convenience.
We look forward to your feedback and the opportunity to work with Prosp=
er International Real Estate.
Thank you.
Kind regards,
Talha Sheraz
Business Development Executive
SGC Tech


